{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/036c21641f3188f463ec397affdadb17.avif?t=1761331202\" width=638 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morphos is a psychological horror/adventure game in which you play as a man who has recently been discharged from a psychiatric hospital after losing his memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon returning home, your wife, a research scientist, out of compassion and a desire to keep an eye on you, arranges for you to join her team. Your workplace turns out to be a gloomy and mysterious underground complex where experiments with anomalous phenomena are conducted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/ef0818edc9faba4261c45edce6ec4251.poster.avif?t=1761331202\" width=638 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/ef0818edc9faba4261c45edce6ec4251.webm?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/ef0818edc9faba4261c45edce6ec4251.mp4?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, everything seems like an attempt to return to normal life, but soon strange things begin to happen underground:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality begins to distort, walls \u201cbreathe,\u201d and familiar objects change shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal anomalies and spatial shifts occur\u2014corridors lead nowhere they should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colleagues are acting increasingly suspiciously, and your wife seems to be hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin to see shadows and hear sounds, and the line between memories, hallucinations, and reality becomes blurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.poster.avif?t=1761331202\" width=638 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.webm?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.mp4?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character asks himself: what really happened to him before the hospital? What kind of research is really being conducted here? Is he a victim of his own sick mind, or does the dungeon hide something terrible that affects everyone and everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on exploration, puzzle solving, and immersion in a paranoid atmosphere where you can't trust anyone, not even your own wife or yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076480?t=1761331202","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076480?t=1761331202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/d406e95e43fb85a8963edc154dc046de591630dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761331202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/d406e95e43fb85a8963edc154dc046de591630dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761331202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"