ld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your colleagues are acting increasingly suspiciously, and your wife seems to be hiding something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin to see shadows and hear sounds, and the line between memories, hallucinations, and reality becomes blurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.poster.avif?t=1761331202\" width=638 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.webm?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/extras/60ab88d3212a5945ccd57a8b654d3c32.mp4?t=1761331202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character asks himself: what really happened to him before the hospital? What kind of research is really being conducted here? Is he a victim of his own sick mind, or does the dungeon hide something terrible that affects everyone and everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is based on exploration, puzzle solving, and immersion in a paranoid atmosphere where you can't trust anyone, not even your own wife or yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","developers":["Langonier"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076480/377b5507827e3019d019b9a02e56d47cf48b80b9/header.jpg?t=1761331202","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076480/1495679871/27b00f098515ac4bf41562bad81f52af4f9366fd/1760811161/dash_av1.mpd?t=176121667